  (junction (at 106.68 77.47) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "b1dc1e1a-6bb5-5a52-822c-7b57a732e1c9"))
  (junction (at 54.61 54.61) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "67b9a4bd-3302-53ca-83bd-e09b385e6c01"))
  (junction (at 38.1 80.01) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "dcca4a93-36db-594b-9cd7-0805937f8492"))
  (text "DRV8833PW: 1.5 A per bridge continuous, 2 A peak, VM 2.7 - 10.8 V." (at 25.4 115.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb865d69-d9c4-5d41-a62e-dacf524d51bd"))
  (text "AISEN and BISEN are tied to ground - no current sensing, so the" (at 25.4 120.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "24ea05f3-a4f8-5d02-8c58-af137dfd322b"))
  (text "current limit is the part's own internal one." (at 25.4 125.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62ae1936-1daa-55af-bcc1-3e703c71d263"))
  (text "C3 10 nF is the charge pump flying capacitor between VM and VCP;" (at 25.4 130.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7293619d-3b79-5d30-82b1-3ce305521fc6"))
  (text "the datasheet asks for 10 nF and nothing else will do." (at 25.4 135.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ecd25c18-bf2e-5be4-b03c-6e68b8432ba0"))
  (text "C4 1 uF bypasses VINT, the internal 3.3 V regulator, which also" (at 25.4 140.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "24f22977-e625-5bb2-8e39-eca47e480f17"))
  (text "pulls up the open-drain nFAULT through R1." (at 25.4 145.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94f5efa7-c752-5d11-978b-aad389adedfa"))
  (text "C1 100 uF / 25 V on a rail that can reach 10.8 V - more than the" (at 25.4 150.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0aab93a2-3bea-5b51-847b-333fcdf15dcd"))
  (text "1.5x headroom, and enough bulk for the motor current steps." (at 25.4 155.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a3ecf649-0ca4-5145-8dab-9186127d794e"))
  (text "The motor terminals are unpolarised. The package brings AOUT1/AOUT2" (at 25.4 160.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ad67b662-2eb4-5771-9be2-d880853bc20c"))
  (text "out in the opposite order to BOUT1/BOUT2, so the fan-out lands A on" (at 25.4 165.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebf17f68-6f00-5741-a555-c4cb5f61a919"))
  (text "J2 one way round and B on J3 the other; the silk says A and B." (at 25.4 170.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b220773-960b-503a-b6d5-29fcbb0e902f"))
  (text "The ground pour covers the driver and the output tracks. It stops" (at 25.4 176.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a2682faa-c5dd-56b4-9a22-07127c7d0468"))
  (text "short of the connectors so the back of the right hand third is free" (at 25.4 181.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "08d4b9c2-97de-5b1b-8489-1ef22b13bf3f"))
  (text "for the two crossings the logic needs." (at 25.4 186.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa08f38d-9778-5eba-82aa-99807b5ca470"))
